</div>
</section>
<section>
<h2 style="text-align:center;font-size:2.4rem;margin-bottom:40px;">Choose Your Path</h2>
<div class="compare">
<div class="side old">
<h3>Without PathKeeper</h3>
<ul>
<li>✕ Endless Google searches</li>
<li>✕ Random career advice</li>
<li>✕ Missed scholarships</li>
