<li>✓ Better financial decisions</li>
<li>✓ Consistent long-term growth</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cta">
<h2>Don't Leave Your Future To Chance.</h2>
<p>The difference between where you are today and where you'll be five years from now is largely determined by the decisions you make starting today.</p>
<a href="https://sites.google.com/view/pathkeeper/home" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Start Building Your Future</a>
</section>
<footer>© 2026 PathKeeper • Designed to Help You Keep Moving Forward</footer>
</body>
</html>
